docs {
  # Admin Delete DataShare Stock
  
  Deletes a mistaken datashare stock load before customers have used it.
  
  This is for cases like loading SIM 1 by mistake when the stock should have
  been loaded on SIM 2.
  
  The backend allows deletion only when:
  
  - `soldMb` is `0`;
  - no usage records are linked to the batch.
  
  If sales have touched the batch, deletion is blocked. Update the batch status
  to `disabled` instead.
}
